# Qu'Bia Arena's Rank 5 Mission (battlefield 512) by a level 75 Bastokan White Mage on Darkness Rising at status 11 with
# the New Fei'Yin Seal: BC_Entrance 32000, area 1; Dia on the Archlich: he engages her (his target); the battlefield
# tick's pulses spawn the Warriors out of her sight (no 00E: nothing shows when); at the kill the allDeath tells her
# client of the two Sorcerers and the four Warriors (+3 to +6) as despawned and WON; the win's 32001 finish runs the
# battlefield's (Archmage Assassin) and Darkness Rising's (the Burnt Seal, status 12, the New Fei'Yin Seal taken).
lists QubiaArena/BC_Entrance/onTrigger QubiaArena/Burning_Circle/onTrigger QubiaArena/onEventUpdate/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32000 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32003 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32001 QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32002
char zone=QubiaArena pos=-212.2,-24.6,20.1 job=WHM lvl=75 nation=1
